"releaseNotes":"Hi, it's Max!\n\nA little update to keep your reminders exactly on time.\n\n[Reminders arrive on time]\nWe fixed an issue where a reminder might not ring — even while your screen was locked. Max will be right on time, every time.\n\n[Your changes take effect]\nWhen you add or change a medication, it now reflects in your reminders correctly. And meds you've removed won't keep ringing.\n\nMax is here with you.", "version":"3.1.7", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Hey there, health champs! It's me, Max, your pill-popping pal. Let's grow those healthy habits together with my friendly reminders!\n\n[NEW] Share & Care\nInvite family or friends to manage medication reminders together!\nNow you can easily look after your parents' meds from afar.\nNo more daily \"Did you take your pills?\" calls!\n\n[How to use Max]\n▸ Fetch your reminders! You can set personalized schedules—daily, on specific days, or at intervals.\n\n▸ When Max's \"Woof Woof\" alarm sounds, chow down on your meds and hit the \"taken\" button. Max automatically records the medicine name and time, crafting a pawsitively awesome health journal.\n\n▸ If there's no response to the timely push notification, Max will bark up your phone again. *It's not a real call, so don't be startled!\n\n[Recommended for]\n▸ From conception to 16 weeks of pregnancy: Folate plays a major role in cell creation. Don't gobble it all up at once—Max suggests a daily dose with his \"Pill Paws\" alert to keep things steady.\n\n▸ Office pups glued to screens: If those peepers are feeling ruff, set Max's \"3-Hour Howler\" alarm to keep those eyes rested. Adding some lutein to the mix is a real tail-wagger, too!\n\n▸ Diabetic dogs on meds: Those taking diabetes meds might run low on Vitamin B. It's like the secret sauce for energy production, so Max's reminder pack always includes this woof-tastic nutrient.\n\n▸ Caring for parents from afar: Hard to keep track of your parents' meds? Use Share & Care to check their medication status in real-time!\n\nStay barking healthy with Max's tail-wagging reminders!", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.7705999999999999516830939683131873607635498046875, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":4.7705999999999999516830939683131873607635498046875, "bundleId":"com.artifyapp.mcare", "trackCensoredName":"Max - Pill reminder", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/max-pill-reminder/id1502063556?uo=4", "trackId":1502063556, "trackName":"Max - Pill reminder", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":9878}, 
