"releaseNotes":"What's new in 1.1.0\n• Home Screen widgets! Add one to see your next dose at a glance — tap it to log the dose. Hold the small widget and tap Edit Widget to choose which pill it shows, or use the medium widget to see them all.\n• Sound settings: tap the speaker button (top-left) to turn off the in-app alarm or the \"taken\" chime. Reminders still ring when the app is closed.\n• The tutorial (tap ?) now covers both.\n\nThanks for using Pill Reminder!", "version":"1.1.0", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Pill Reminder is the simplest way to remember your medications.\n\nEach pill is a big, colorful capsule that fills up as its next dose gets closer — a glance tells you how long you have left. When it's time, the pill turns fully colored and an alarm rings until you open the app, so you won't miss a dose.\n\nTake your pill, tap it, and the countdown resets for the next one. That's it.\n\n• Track up to 4 medications at once, each in its own color\n• A clear countdown on every pill, filling as time passes\n• An alarm that keeps reminding you until you act — and counts how overdue you are\n• Tap to log a dose with a gentle chime; long-press to edit, snooze 5 minutes, or finish a medication\n• Set any schedule: every 4, 6, 8, 12, or 24 hours, or a custom interval\n• Works completely offline — no account, no ads, no tracking. Your schedule never leaves your phone.\n\nPerfect for a course of antibiotics, daily vitamins, or any routine where timing matters.\n\nPill Reminder is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice. Always follow your doctor's or pharmacist's instructions.", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":5, "contentAdvisoryRating":"4+", "averageUserRating":5, "bundleId":"com.tokkico.pillreminder", "trackCensoredName":"Super Simple Pill Reminder", "trackViewUrl":"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/super-simple-pill-reminder/id6784130917?uo=4", "trackId":6784130917, "trackName":"Super Simple Pill Reminder", "price":0.00, "userRatingCount":4}, 
